      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Current version of [GOPATH_environment_variable](https://pkg.go.dev/cmd/go@go1.20rc1#hdr-GOPATH_environment_variabl) (as of go1.20rc1)\r\nis still focusing more on the use/layout of GOPATH in GOPATH-mode and is a common source of confusion for users.\r\n\r\nIt is followed by a tiny section [GOPATH_and_Modules](https://pkg.go.dev/cmd/go@go1.20rc1#hdr-GOPATH_and_Modules) but this is really easy to miss.\r\n\r\n\r\ncc @bcmills @matloob @rsc\r\n",
